  "description": "\"Ah...it was another day like no other...\" Takaaki Nasushima, 43 years old. He is a restaurant owner, but he is struggling to make a living and spends his days without money or women. A young and handsome college student, Yuudai, came to Nasujima as a part-timer. \"I would be happy if I could become such a guy...\" I fell asleep with such delusions, and when I woke up... Yuudai's body had been switched!? \"You won't tell me that you're sleepy while you're in the same bed as me.\" teeth…!?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/youthful)",
